      answer: 'Module augmentation in a local .d.ts: declare global { namespace Express { interface Request { user?: AuthUser } } } (for Express\'s global namespace pattern), or `declare module "lib" { interface Request { ... } }` for modular libs. Declaration merging combines your interface with the library\'s. Never edit node_modules; never cast (req as any).user at every call site.',
