        'Convert file-by-file along import order (leaves first) — a converted file whose dependencies are still untyped drowns in implicit any.',
        'Use a ratchet in CI: count errors/any-usages and forbid increases. @ts-expect-error with a ticket reference for legitimate deferrals (it self-expires by erroring when fixed).',
        'Automate the mechanical part: ts-migrate or codemods for renames and trivial annotations; humans handle the model design.',
        'Track wins: strictNullChecks typically surfaces real latent bugs — publicize a few to keep buy-in.',
