        'Introduce schema validation at every external boundary (HTTP, websockets, localStorage, URL params): zod/valibot schemas that parse-don\'t-validate, throwing or returning Result on mismatch.',
        'Derive static types FROM the schemas (z.infer) so the runtime check and the compile-time type are a single source of truth that cannot drift.',
